  "invite.aBusiness": "a business",
  "invite.body": "You have been invited to help manage {business} on Luminous StockHaven{byInviter}.\n\nCreate your account with this email address, then sign in — your staff access will be ready. If you did not expect this invitation, you can ignore this email.",
