  "backup.body": "Habari,\n\nMsimbo wako wa barua pepe mbadala wa Luminous StockHaven ni {code}. Unaisha baada ya dakika 10.\n\nWewe (au mtu aliyeingia kama wewe) aliomba kuweka anwani hii kama\nbarua pepe mbadala ya akaunti ya Luminous StockHaven — ufunguo wa ziada ambao\nunaweza kusaidia kurejesha akaunti kama barua pepe kuu ikipotea.\nMaliza hatua hii tu kama unaitambua.\n\n— Luminous StockHaven",
  "backup.subject": "Msimbo wako wa barua pepe mbadala wa Luminous StockHaven",
