  "final.subject": "Saa 24 hadi jaribio lako la Luminous StockHaven liishe",
  "invite.aBusiness": "biashara",
  "invite.body": "Umealikwa kusaidia kusimamia {business} kwenye Luminous StockHaven{byInviter}.\n\nFungua akaunti yako kwa anwani hii ya barua pepe, kisha ingia — ufikiaji wako wa wafanyakazi utakuwa tayari. Kama hukutarajia mwaliko huu, unaweza kupuuza barua pepe hii.",
  "invite.byInviter": " na {inviterName}",
  "invite.subject": "Umealikwa kwenye {business}",
  "newEmail.body": "Habari,\n\nMsimbo wako mpya wa barua pepe wa Luminous StockHaven ni {code}. Unaisha baada ya dakika 10.\n\nWeka msimbo huu kumaliza kuhamisha akaunti ya Luminous StockHaven kwenda\nanwani hii. Duka lako, bidhaa zako na ufikiaji wa timu yako vinahamia\nnayo — hakuna kinachobaki, na hakuna jaribio jipya la bila malipo linaloanza.\nKama hukuomba hii, puuza barua pepe hii.\n\n— Luminous StockHaven",
  "newEmail.subject": "Thibitisha barua pepe yako mpya ya Luminous StockHaven",
  "po.expectedBy": "Inatarajiwa kufikia: {date}",
  "po.fullOrder": "Agizo kamili — kila mstari, kiasi na bei — liko katika PDF iliyoambatishwa.",
  "po.helloLine": "Tafadhali pata iliyoambatishwa agizo la ununuzi {number} kutoka {business}.",
